WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Presets: Apply Draw stroke to the selected rings and play the actual animation.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Keyframes: Add a key with the native keyboard shortcut and undo it.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Pop in: Apply Pop in and play the resulting animation.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Slide up: Apply Slide up and play the resulting animation.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Layers: Compare blend modes and play the edited animation.
